# TelemetryService web.client needs .vscode/launch.json checked in so VS 2026's
# JavaScript SDK deploy step has a launch profile to read (otherwise it throws
# "Value cannot be null. Parameter name: source" on F5). The pair below re-includes
# the directory, re-excludes its contents, then re-includes just launch.json.
!src/TelemetryService/web.client/.vscode/
src/TelemetryService/web.client/.vscode/*
!src/TelemetryService/web.client/.vscode/launch.json
